-            *   AABB: `from_min_max(Vec3::ZERO, Vec3::splat(32.0))` [S1, unofficial].
-            *   Mesh Handle.
-            *   Global Material (opaque or translucent based on block types) [S1, S2, unofficial].
-        g.  Insert the new entity into the `chunk_entities` map [S1, unofficial].
